        "The current monitoring integration tracks official export artifact changes in the data.gov.be DCAT repository, not every individual dataset record inside the full RDF dump.",
        "Use this source primarily for catalog discovery and supporting realism inputs, then layer official statistics on top when you need explicit population representativeness."
      ]
